From: Xbox360 Blades <xbox360-blades@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 16:32:02 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 30/51] Exit Session relaunches the dashboard into its network
 test

createprofile's Exit Session -> Yes (90102AD8 -> 90102088) sets launch
data (0x3FC bytes, +4 = 2, +8 = user index) and calls
XamLoaderLaunchTitleEx(NULL, NULL, NULL, 0). The Guide now does the same.
The 2858 dash reads it and opens Test Xbox Live Connection.

Handoff: a NULL path boots the disc only with flag 0x2 (xam 818C3228:
request type 1; the disc tile passes 0x12), otherwise it is the dashboard
(type 8). Launch data is carried to the next Xenia in
dashboard_launch_data.bin and read when xam starts. LoadLoaderData now
reports whether launch_data.bin was there, so that data does not start
Xenia's own title restart.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AFb8CDFE1Ms5NnJH88eG8b
